# RevIQ AI: Environment Variables
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill in any values you want to override.
# The .env file is listed in .gitignore and will never be committed.
#
# The project runs fully without any API keys.
# The only optional key is OPENAI_API_KEY, which enables LLM-generated
# answers in the Revenue Copilot dashboard page.
# Without it, the Copilot runs in fallback mode: it retrieves the most
# relevant sections from the knowledge base and displays them directly,
# with no LLM interpretation applied.

# Optional: enables LLM mode in the Revenue Copilot.
# Get a key at https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
